AFB3DB3"}, {"file_name": "Vinetra_Scrshot5.png", "id": "1698914684421545", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298150_1698914687754878_6550392051129348489_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2Rg-QzLpSZ8Q7kNvwElKVKl&_nc_oc=Adp3W0y6vAZEv4g3TXu5jXTd1lMo3WGESGivKKo_J6eve5Sg3lACBo1IylNetn13Fz8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTNniWF8Os9_Vw-BilCNOTpUf2fXoijK1F_7LbG_c085A&oe=6AFB4580"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Vinetra: Multiplayer Survival", "keywords": ["survival", "multiplayer", "pvp", "roguelite", "gorilla"], "long_description": "# Vinetra: Multiplayer Survival\n\n\n**Features**\n\n\ud83c\udf32SURVIVE THE WILD\n- Physics based locomotion makes movement fun and engaging. Use your hands to run, climb, and survive in a large open world designed for movement.\n\n- Every life is a new attempt. Master the mechanics, learn the map, and survive longer than your last run. **Death is permanent**!\n\n\n\ud83c\udf92CRAFT & TRADE\n- Inventory management: Every slot matters. Balance your resources between food, tools & materials.\n\n- Sell & Trade for the weapons you need to survive the night. From primitive weapons to essential gear, your survival depends on what you can get.\n\n\u2694\ufe0f8 PLAYER BATTLES\n- You aren't alone. Compete or cooperate with up to 8 players in a free for all environment where placing full trust in someone can end in your demise.\n\n- Enemies are everywhere. Always be on the lookout for animals ready to kill.\n\n\u26a0\ufe0fEARLY ACCESS NOTE\n- **Vinetra is in early access.** Please expect bugs. Report them in-game, or in our Discord server, and help make Vinetra better for everyone!\n\n**How long can YOU last?**", "short_description": "Vinetra is a multiplayer survival game."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.vineswingersgames.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_s